{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"saveMeta"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"docKey"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"bytes"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"docKey","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The key of the document whose header is being recorded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"bytes","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The serialized header."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It leaves the snapshot alone – an online client syncs constantly, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-snapshotting per sync would reintroduce the cost this interface exists to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"avoid – and it leaves the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"log"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" alone too."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That second part is load-bearing. The log does two jobs: it holds un-pushed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changes so they survive a reload, and it is the delta between the snapshot and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the document’s current content. Deleting acknowledged entries serves the first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"job and destroys the second, because nothing brings the snapshot forward on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"push-ack – the content would then exist in neither place while the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"serverSeq"},{"type":"text","text":" claims the server has it. Only compaction trims the log, and it does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so by folding the entries into a new snapshot first."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The header itself carries the acknowledged "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientSeq"},{"type":"text","text":", so a restore reads it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from there; the store needs no separate parameter for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a no-op when nothing is stored for the key."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any error the underlying storage raises."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore"]]},"metadata":{"required":true,"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Yorkie8DocStoreP8saveMeta6docKey5bytesySS_10Foundation4DataVtYaKF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"required":true,"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore\/savemeta(dockey:bytes:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"title":"saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the post-sync header."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DocStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","title":"Yorkie","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","abstract":[]}}}